Package: linux-whatsapp-web
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4), python3
Description: Brave WhatsApp Web PWA setup and IBus diagnostic helper
 A small community helper that discovers an installed WhatsApp Web PWA in
 Brave, creates a correctly grouped desktop launcher, and safely diagnoses
 common IBus keyboard-input failures. It contains no browser or session data.
